### Upload Profile Picture
POST http://localhost:5000/users/update-profile
Content-Type: multipart/form-data

{
    "profile": "<file>"
}

### Get User and Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/users/get_user_and_profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "6a3c8fadc87ac9463fd238466a26da668c1be082c01e70b63a9529a1afefb7e0"
}

### Update Profile Data
POST http://localhost:5000/users/update_profile_data
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "token": "6a3c8fadc87ac9463fd238466a26da668c1be082c01e70b63a9529a1afefb7e0",
    "bio": "Updated bio",
    "currentwork": {
        "company": "New Company",
        "position": "New Position"
    },
    "postwork": [
        {
            "company": "Old Company",
            "position": "Old Position"
        }
    ],
    "education": [
        {
            "institution": "New University",
            "degree": "New Degree"
        }
    ]
}

